    "text": "Notice for payload engineers: Since 2041-02-18, Valerius firmware 4.1.9 displays `overpressure` when the auxiliary tank exceeds 450 kPa. This state means the panel freezes the last validated flow rate; it does not mean the main valve has failed. If `overpressure` persists for 5 minutes, engineers should inspect the relief valve. When bypass `BYP-11` is active, engineers must not reset the module. A reset clears the display but does not vent the tank.",
